estination write sink; the source does not enforce the required destination authorization before the sink.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"POST /process/file dispatches to process_file, which receives the verified user dependency.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-eaa1fec9716aeb48","startLine":1546,"endLine":1552}]},{"id":"f-source-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"For a non-admin caller, process_file retrieves the file using the supplied file ID together with user.id.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-eaa1fec9716aeb48","startLine":1559,"endLine":1564}]},{"id":"f-destination-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"process_file uses the caller-supplied collection_name, defaulting only when it is absent, and passes that value as collection_name to the vector-save helper.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-eaa1fec9716aeb48","startLine":1564,"endLine":1571}]},{"id":"f-source-control","kind":"control","statement":"The visible authorization control checks the non-admin caller's ownership/access to the source file through get_file_by_id_and_user_id; no destination collection ownership or write-grant check appears before the save call.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-eaa1fec9716aeb48","startLine":1559,"endLine":1564}]},{"id":"f-save-path","kind":"condition","statement":"When embedding and retrieval are not bypassed, process_file invokes save_docs_to_vector_db with the selected collection_name and sets add to true when collection_name was supplied by the caller.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-eaa1fec9716aeb48","startLine":1683,"endLine":1705}]},{"id":"f-existing-collection","kind":"condition","statement":"save_docs_to_vector_db detects an existing collection and proceeds when add is true; it returns early only when both overwrite is false and add is false.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-eaa1fec9716aeb48","startLine":1458,"endLine":1467}]},{"id":"f-write-sink","kind":"effect","statement":"save_docs_to_vector_db inserts the generated text/vector items into the selected collection through VECTOR_DB_CLIENT.insert.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-eaa1fec9716aeb48","startLine":1517,"endLine":1531}]},{"id":"f-separate-validator","kind":"control","statement":"The supplied source separately defines _validate_collection_access, which filters requested collections and can reject denied access, but the shown process_file path does not invoke it.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-eaa1fec9716aeb48","startLine":2339,"endLine":2352}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":7081,"output":1048,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":28189.4318,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-29T19:06:06.932Z"}}
